The fix: use `is_char_boundary` or `char_indices`:
```rust
let ts_short = if event.ts.len() >= 10 {
    let mut end = 10;
    while end > 0 && !event.ts.is_char_boundary(end) {
        end -= 1;
    }
    &event.ts[..end]
} else {
    &event.ts
};
```

